          MODULE=kmscon
         VERSION=10.1.2
          SOURCE=$MODULE-$VERSION.tar.gz
 SOURCE_URL_FULL=https://github.com/kmscon/kmscon/archive/refs/tags/v$VERSION.tar.gz
      SOURCE_VFY=sha256:ba683806d517b1dfc9cfbca0e9d5c2653b62d1fbf41918c00fa1d5c837626044
        WEB_SITE=https://github.com/kmscon/kmscon
         ENTERED=20261120
         UPDATED=20261120
           SHORT="DRM/KMS Linux graphic console"

cat << EOF_DESCRIPTION
KMSCON is a DRM/KMS userspace terminal emulator. This local Lunar module
applies Florin's four ordered clipboard patches to upstream KMSCON 10.1.2, builds
the native X11/Wayland user-session peers, and provides optional, manual-only
dinit service templates. No Xvfb, systemd, libseat, D-Bus or accelerated OpenGL
backend is required by the selected DRM2D profile.
EOF_DESCRIPTION
